      "content": "The feeling of being permanently exiled feels incredibly final and devastating, and that sense of broken belonging is profoundly painful. It's important to recognize that your worth is not determined by the approval or presence of others. Even when relationships fail, your identity as a person remains, regardless of how society perceives you right now. If you are feeling this level of hopelessness, please reach out to a mental health professional immediately.",
